{"id":"ca2d757f82798122","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-syntax.md","title":"两个 sort、混合语境与四种依赖","display":"df-fhodtt-syntax — 两个 sort、混合语境与四种依赖","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-syntax","FHoDTT syntax"],"display":"df-fhodtt-syntax — 两个 sort、混合语境与四种依赖","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]"],"review_status":"source-rule-core-reconstructed","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J04","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§11.5, Definition 11.5.1 and Figure 11.1, pp. 685–689 (PDF 705–709)","review_scope":"Annotated two-sort formation, explicit binding and substitution; split semantic interface","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-syntax</span><span>FHoDTT syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fhodtt-syntax — 两个 sort、混合语境与四种依赖"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-rule-core-reconstructed"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J04"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5, Definition 11.5.1 and Figure 11.1, pp. 685–689 (PDF 705–709)"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Annotated two-sort formation, explicit binding and substitution; split semantic interface"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是可数无穷变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 是不同的 sort 标识。表达式和有限上下文按下面的语法取有限树编码，模捕获避免的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 换名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\\in S\">\\(s,t,u\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V\">\\(x,y,z\\in V\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:W\\to\\mathsf{Expr}\">\\(\\sigma:W\\to\\mathsf{Expr}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq V\">\\(W\\subseteq V\\)</span> 有限；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e[\\sigma]\">\\(e[\\sigma]\\)</span> 表示有限、同时、捕获避免替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(e)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(e)\\)</span> 是自由变量集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 与保留构造子（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>）不交。原始表达式含两个 sort 常元；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 可出现在判断右侧，但没有以它为被分类表达式的 sort 公理，因此没有增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}:s\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}:s\\)</span> 的规则。</li>\n<li>元判断为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\">\\(\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\\)</span>、同类型判断等式，以及上下文替换 judgment。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的 sort 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 没有更高 sort 判断。规则的变量绑定与 sort 标记必须合法；判断的可推导性由显示前提及有限推导闭包决定；模式实例只按原始文法、绑定和显式 sort 侧条件生成，不预先假定前提或结论可推导。</li>\n<li>原始语境声明记录为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,s,C)\">\\((x,s,C)\\)</span>，显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x:C\">\\(x:C\\)</span> 时其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 由同一规则的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:s\">\\(C:s\\)</span> 前提或既有声明取出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:C\">\\(\\Gamma,x:C\\)</span> 不丢弃此 sort 标签。项节点的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,x.D)\">\\((C,x.D)\\)</span> 注释也是树的一部分；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^{s,t}x:C.b\">\\(\\lambda^{s,t}x:C.b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}(f,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}(f,a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}(a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}(a,b)\\)</span> 分别缩写带该注释的节点，且仅在当前规则已固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:s,D:t\">\\(C:s,D:t\\)</span> 时使用。split 还携带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,x.D,z.E)\">\\((C,x.D,z.E)\\)</span>；其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 中绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，分支中绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span>。节点域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 不在这些绑定域内。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\)</span> 是同一个带类型表达式判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash e:D\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash e:D\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=s\">\\(D=s\\)</span> 时的特例；它不是第二个无关联的判断标签。上下文良构、该统一类型判断、判断等式与替换判断的可导性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a> 的同一个最小规则闭包定义。</li>\n<li>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\)</span> 仅为本规则呈现的固定标识；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\)</span> 为下节定义的语法记录。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\)</span> 是本原子显示的形成规则模式集合；其标号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f\">\\(c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f\\)</span> 分别指向下面六条模式。项与转换规则独立定义于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a>，不以未展开的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TyRule}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{TyRule}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 或 DTT 签名代替它们。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type})\\}\\cup\n\\{(s,t,u)\\in S^3\\mid(s,t)\\ne(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type})\\}\\cup\n\\{(s,t,u)\\in S^3\\mid(s,t)\\ne(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ne\\in\\mathsf{Expr}::={}&amp;x\\mid\\mathsf{Type}\\mid\\mathsf{Kind}\\mid1_s\\mid()_s\n\\mid\\Pi^{s,t}(x:e).e\\mid\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:e).e\\\\\n&amp;\\mid\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(e,e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(e,e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(e;x,y.e),\\\\\n&amp;C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Expr},\\qquad s,t,u\\in S,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}::={}&amp;()\\mid\\Gamma,(x,s,e).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ne\\in\\mathsf{Expr}::={}&amp;x\\mid\\mathsf{Type}\\mid\\mathsf{Kind}\\mid1_s\\mid()_s\n\\mid\\Pi^{s,t}(x:e).e\\mid\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:e).e\\\\\n&amp;\\mid\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(e,e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(e,e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(e;x,y.e),\\\\\n&amp;C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Expr},\\qquad s,t,u\\in S,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}::={}&amp;()\\mid\\Gamma,(x,s,e).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\n\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},1_s,()_s\\mid s\\in S\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup((\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(b))\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(K^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(b)\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(E)\\setminus\\{z\\})\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(p)\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(d)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\n\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},1_s,()_s\\mid s\\in S\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup((\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(b))\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(K^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(b)\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(E)\\setminus\\{z\\})\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(p)\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(d)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(v)),\\\\\nx[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\sigma(x)&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma,\\\\x&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad c[\\sigma]\\coloneqq c\n\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},1_s,()_s\\mid s\\in S\\}),\\\\\n(\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C[\\sigma]).D[\\sigma]\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n(\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma]}(x.b[\\sigma]),\\\\\n(K^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\nK^{s,t}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma]}(a[\\sigma],b[\\sigma])\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair}\\}),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma],z.E[\\sigma]}(p[\\sigma];x,y.d[\\sigma]),\\\\\n&amp;\\{x,y,z\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(v)),\\\\\nx[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\sigma(x)&amp;x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma,\\\\x&amp;x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad c[\\sigma]\\coloneqq c\n\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},1_s,()_s\\mid s\\in S\\}),\\\\\n(\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C[\\sigma]).D[\\sigma]\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n(\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma]}(x.b[\\sigma]),\\\\\n(K^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\nK^{s,t}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma]}(a[\\sigma],b[\\sigma])\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair}\\}),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma],z.E[\\sigma]}(p[\\sigma];x,y.d[\\sigma]),\\\\\n&amp;\\{x,y,z\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V\\mid(\\exists s\\in S)(\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ (x,s,C)\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\Gamma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V\\mid(\\exists s\\in S)(\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ (x,s,C)\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\Gamma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c_0\\coloneqq\\frac{}{()\\ \\mathsf{ctx}},\\qquad\nc_+\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)}\n{\\Gamma,x:C\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c_0\\coloneqq\\frac{}{()\\ \\mathsf{ctx}},\\qquad\nc_+\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)}\n{\\Gamma,x:C\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Type}:\\mathsf{Kind}},\\qquad\n1_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\quad s\\in S}{\\Gamma\\vdash1_s:s}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Type}:\\mathsf{Kind}},\\qquad\n1_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\quad s\\in S}{\\Gamma\\vdash1_s:s}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D:t},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D:t}\\quad(s,t\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D:t},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D:t}\\quad(s,t\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\coloneqq\\{c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n(V,S,\\mathsf{Expr},\\mathsf{Ctx},\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\coloneqq\\{c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n(V,S,\\mathsf{Expr},\\mathsf{Ctx},\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本轮补入原始树常元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Type}:\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Type}:\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 及 kind 表达式的反身等式都属于所声明的 judgment 文法；原来只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 的原始表达式文法，无法统一实例化等式规则的右侧类型。此为语法编码闭合修复，不新增 universe 或更高 sort 公理。</li>\n<li>来源：§11.5，Definition 11.5.1 与 Figure 11.1，pp. 685–688（PDF 705–708），以及 p. 689（PDF 709）的混合上下文与 term model。这里把书中语法草图编成有限构造子和规则模式；类型、kind、变量项共用表达式树，但它们的判断角色仍由 sort 与上下文决定。</li>\n<li>四个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,t)\">\\((s,t)\\)</span> 组合均有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 形成。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\">\\((\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\)</span> 的和只可消去到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})\">\\((\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})\\)</span> 的很强和可消去到两个 sort。同 sort 的和先在自身 sort 内派生两投影及配对 η，再把任意另一 sort 的消去分支代入两投影；η 提供目标类型转换。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\)</span> 同时列入这两个可导的跨 sort 消去规则，并未增强书中的演算。</li>\n<li>原草稿中的累积 universe hierarchy、独立 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 层与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}\\)</span> 已移除：它们不是 pp. 688–689 所给的 FhoDTT 语法。书中 p. 686（PDF 706）明确把独立 Prop 作为进一步的逻辑扩展；本呈现没有偷加该扩展。</li>\n<li>本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a> 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c7f9132ab843c91\" href=\"?note=5c7f9132ab843c91\" title=\"16-df-identity-type\">16-df-identity-type</a> 的规则包，不能以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"241e7e90b85de13e\" href=\"?note=241e7e90b85de13e\" title=\"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure\">16-df-split-fhodtt-structure</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0fc14f4a062b4abf\" href=\"?note=0fc14f4a062b4abf\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-term-model\">16-df-fhodtt-term-model</a>；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash C:s$ 是同一个带类型表达式判断 $\\Gamma\\vdash e:D$ 在 $D=s$ 时的特例；它不是第二个无关联的判断标签。上下文良构、该统一类型判断、判断等式与替换判断的可导性由 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的同一个最小规则闭包定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下标 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}$ 仅为本规则呈现的固定标识；$\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 为下节定义的语法记录。$\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}$ 是本原子显示的形成规则模式集合；其标号 $c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f$ 分别指向下面六条模式。项与转换规则独立定义于 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]，不以未展开的 $\\mathsf{TyRule}_\\Sigma$ 或 DTT 签名代替它们。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-identity-type","status":"resolved","id":"5c7f9132ab843c91","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure","status":"resolved","id":"241e7e90b85de13e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,u\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:W\\to\\mathsf{Expr}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"e[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(e)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}:s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M:C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"(x,s,C)","display":false},{"tex":"x:C","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"C:s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:C","display":false},{"tex":"(C,x.D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^{s,t}x:C.b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}(f,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"C:s,D:t","display":false},{"tex":"(C,x.D,z.E)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash e:D","display":false},{"tex":"D=s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}","display":false},{"tex":"c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{TyRule}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"S\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type})\\}\\cup\n\\{(s,t,u)\\in S^3\\mid(s,t)\\ne(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ne\\in\\mathsf{Expr}::={}&x\\mid\\mathsf{Type}\\mid\\mathsf{Kind}\\mid1_s\\mid()_s\n\\mid\\Pi^{s,t}(x:e).e\\mid\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:e).e\\\\\n&\\mid\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(e,e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{pair}^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(e,e)\n\\mid\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(e;x,y.e),\\\\\n&C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Expr},\\qquad s,t,u\\in S,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}::={}&()\\mid\\Gamma,(x,s,e).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\n\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},1_s,()_s\\mid s\\in S\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup((\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(b))\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(K^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(b)\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{FV}(C)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(D)\\setminus\\{x\\})\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(E)\\setminus\\{z\\})\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(p)\n\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(d)\\setminus\\{x,y\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma}\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma(v)),\\\\\nx[\\sigma]&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\sigma(x)&x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma,\\\\x&x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad c[\\sigma]\\coloneqq c\n\\quad(c\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},1_s,()_s\\mid s\\in S\\}),\\\\\n(\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C).D)[\\sigma]&\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal B^{s,t}(x:C[\\sigma]).D[\\sigma]\n\\quad(\\mathcal B\\in\\{\\Pi,\\Sigma\\}),\\\\\n(\\lambda^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(x.b))[\\sigma]&\\coloneqq\n\\lambda^{s,t}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma]}(x.b[\\sigma]),\\\\\n(K^{s,t}_{C,x.D}(a,b))[\\sigma]&\\coloneqq\nK^{s,t}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma]}(a[\\sigma],b[\\sigma])\n\\quad(K\\in\\{\\operatorname{app},\\operatorname{pair}\\}),\\\\\n(\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C,x.D,z.E}(p;x,y.d))[\\sigma]&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{split}^{s,t,u}_{C[\\sigma],x.D[\\sigma],z.E[\\sigma]}(p[\\sigma];x,y.d[\\sigma]),\\\\\n&\\{x,y,z\\}\\cap(\\operatorname{dom}\\sigma\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\sigma))=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in V\\mid(\\exists s\\in S)(\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ (x,s,C)\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\Gamma)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"c_0\\coloneqq\\frac{}{()\\ \\mathsf{ctx}},\\qquad\nc_+\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)}\n{\\Gamma,x:C\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}.","display":true},{"tex":"h\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Type}:\\mathsf{Kind}},\\qquad\n1_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\quad s\\in S}{\\Gamma\\vdash1_s:s}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D:t},\\qquad\n\\Sigma_f\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D:t}\\quad(s,t\\in S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\coloneqq\\{c_0,c_+,h,1_f,\\Pi_f,\\Sigma_f\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\coloneqq\n(V,S,\\mathsf{Expr},\\mathsf{Ctx},\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\mathsf{Type}:\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DTTSig}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false}],"bytes":8391,"backlinks":[{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf K_S,\\mathsf A^s_S,\\mathsf V_S,\\mathsf S_S$ 为本页对 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]] 的带注释有限树构造的部分函数。$\\mathsf V_S(\\Gamma,e)$ 的值是三元组 $(s,A,a)$，其中 $A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma)$、$a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\mathsf C_S\\Gamma,A)$；$\\mathsf v_S$ 只取第三分量。每个递归分支只在全部子值已定义、其 sort 和类型分量等于对应操作所需的参数、且所用函数具有该输入时定义；其余输入不定义。$\\downarrow$ 表示有定义。定义域条件只检查语义集合/函数的型属，不检查待证的句法可推导性。"},{"id":"df1066ccd01cf082","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Syntax}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 是 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]] 明确定义的有限表达式、混合语境、和消去 sort 许可及形成规则记录；上标 $\\mathrm{legacy}$ 区分历史拼写。"},{"id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FHoDTT}$ 是下节用有限推导树定义的演算标识；不预先假定任何未显示的规则。采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]] 的 $V,S,e,\\Gamma,\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}$。$\\Gamma\\vdash C:s$、$\\Gamma\\vdash M:C$ 及同类型判断等式分别记为 formation、term 与 equality 判断；$\\alpha$ 换名按原始语法取商。"},{"id":"241e7e90b85de13e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定足够大的集合论宇宙。$S$ 是候选记录，含小范畴 $\\mathcal C$、对象 $\\mathbf1$、箭头族 $!_\\Gamma$；$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]。sort 集 $\\mathcal S=\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$ 与和消去许可集 $\\mathcal A_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"},{"id":"97331c72a05275ec","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的混合语境、表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$ 与有限推导关系 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J$。固定良构 $\\Gamma$；$s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。下节使用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组编码构造 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$；所有显示的绑定变量均对其所在上下文及其绑定域外的表达式新鲜；绑定名按 $\\alpha$ 等同。$[M]_{C,D}$ 表示转换类，$[M]:C\\to D$ 则简写带源靶标签的 $\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle$。对象、箭头、恒等和复合的记录均在 Assertion 给出。"}],"outgoing":["3930e297a315728a","5c7f9132ab843c91","241e7e90b85de13e","0fc14f4a062b4abf"]}